173:1. Mistral 7B struggles to generate parallel tool calls correctly.
174:2. **For Transformers tokenization backend only**: Mistral's `tokenizer_config.json` chat template requires tool call IDs that are exactly 9 digits, which is
178:    * [examples/tool_chat_template_mistral.jinja](../../examples/tool_chat_template_mistral.jinja) - this is the "official" Mistral chat template, but tweaked so that
179:      it works with vLLM's tool call IDs (provided `tool_call_id` fields are truncated to the last 9 digits)
